5. **Serious — H2’s key future transition is not exercised by the stated replay.** [Plan lines 94 and 176]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:94) propose opening a later question when the earlier deadline expires. The stored Kyber example’s earlier deadline is December 31, 2027, while the sealed replay ends in August 2026. The [planned measurements]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:142) do not state a check that advances through that expiry. A replay could pass while the deferred successor never opens.

6. **Factual — the shared-quantity comparison list is capped.** [Plan line 34]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:34) says the list includes *all* questions with the same theme and quantity. [matching.py, lines 137–140]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/views/matching.py:137) caps that list at `top_n`. Separately, [jev_matching.py, lines 104–118]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:104) searches the family to select the shared-quantity destination. Those are different operations.

7. **Wording-level — section 12 still says the ACP verdicts were changed to “mutually contradictory.”** [Plan line 202]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:202) conflicts with the corrected account at [lines 16–20]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:16), which correctly says the candidates differed and the cause is unproven.

The ACP “guarantee and financing” sentence is in both the [signed standard, line 318]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:318) and the [collision prompt]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/prompts/collision-v1.txt:1). The revised plan no longer claims it caused the split or that the two standard sentences necessarily conflict. H1–H5 now name their relevant boundaries as choices; H7’s lean retains D204’s two records. The census totals match the recorded outputs, but its verdict categories remain provisional because the [script parses reason text]( /Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/census/admission_census.py:18). I did not independently verify every archived verdict, quotation or cost estimate.

