   144	|  | Candidate thesis | Evidence |
   145	|---|---|---|
   146	| Comparison set | Top N search results from the entire thesis library | Top N evidence results within its thesis |
   147	| Decision | Existing identity or part, succession, new thesis or skip | Repeat, replace or new evidence |
